<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Adrenaline"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Dream"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="PmBata"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Adrenaline"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUG12601083"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3347119419"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="000jlRLD30atjp"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="7eCXHpE12jpjAfcKvyLR45"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="GaBoron"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Dream</songwriter><songwriter>Parker Makani Bata</songwriter><songwriter>Andrew Goldstein</songwriter><songwriter>Jesse St.John Geller</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:14.064"><div begin="2.821" end="3:14.064"><p begin="2.821" end="5.635" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2.821" end="3.025">Sim</span><span begin="3.025" end="3.205">ple</span> <span begin="3.205" end="3.410">sto</span><span begin="3.410" end="3.605">ry</span> <span begin="3.605" end="3.800">about</span> <span begin="3.800" end="4.025">a</span> <span begin="4.025" end="4.425">man</span> <span begin="4.425" end="4.603">that</span> <span begin="4.603" end="4.785">got</span> <span begin="4.785" end="5.024">framed</span> <span begin="5.024" end="5.190">on</span> <span begin="5.190" end="5.365">a</span> <span begin="5.365" end="5.635">wall</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这是一个简单的故事关于一个被挂在通缉墙上的人</span></p><p begin="6.064" end="8.790" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.064" end="6.215">Had</span> <span begin="6.215" end="6.390">a</span> <span begin="6.390" end="6.562">pic</span><span begin="6.562" end="6.782">ture</span> <span begin="6.782" end="6.970">and</span> <span begin="6.970" end="7.205">a</span> <span begin="7.205" end="7.585">name</span> <span begin="7.585" end="7.750">and</span> <span begin="7.750" end="7.935">a</span> <span begin="7.935" end="8.130">num</span><span begin="8.130" end="8.330">ber</span> <span begin="8.330" end="8.545">to</span> <span begin="8.545" end="8.790">call</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">附着照片写着名字，还有一个电话号码</span></p><p begin="9.005" end="11.990" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.005" end="9.150">They</span> <span begin="9.150" end="9.335">start</span><span begin="9.335" end="9.555">ed</span> <span begin="9.555" end="9.775">ring</span><span begin="9.775" end="9.950">ing</span> <span begin="9.950" end="10.180">sstart</span><span begin="10.180" end="10.365">ed</span> <span begin="10.365" end="10.780">singing</span> <span begin="10.780" end="10.970">out</span> <span begin="10.970" end="11.164">his</span> <span begin="11.164" end="11.355">name</span> <span begin="11.355" end="11.545">in</span> <span begin="11.545" end="11.775">the</span> <span begin="11.775" end="11.990">hall</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">电话铃声此起彼伏，他的名字在长廊里回响</span></p><p begin="12.361" end="14.415" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.361" end="12.535">No</span> <span begin="12.535" end="12.735">one</span> <span begin="12.735" end="12.930">won</span><span begin="12.930" end="13.125">dered</span> <span begin="13.125" end="13.310">if</span> <span begin="13.310" end="13.510">he</span> <span begin="13.510" end="13.705">did</span> <span begin="13.705" end="13.925">it</span> <span begin="13.925" end="14.141">at</span> <span begin="14.141" end="14.415">all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">没人关心他是否真的有罪</span></p><p begin="15.559" end="18.479" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.559" end="15.744">There&apos;s</span> <span begin="15.744" end="15.944">a</span> <span begin="15.944" end="16.324">mob</span> <span begin="16.324" end="16.499">at</span> <span begin="16.499" end="16.704">the</span> <span begin="16.704" end="17.134">door</span> <span begin="17.134" end="17.494">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="17.494" end="17.684">about</span> <span begin="17.684" end="17.899">to</span> <span begin="17.899" end="18.094">get</span> <span begin="18.094" end="18.479">bloody</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">暴民已在门外聚集，一场血腥即将降临</span></p><p begin="18.729" end="21.724" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.729" end="18.914">Had</span> <span begin="18.914" end="19.094">some</span> <span begin="19.094" end="19.494">friends</span> <span begin="19.494" end="19.694">by</span> <span begin="19.694" end="19.899">his</span> <span begin="19.899" end="20.304">side</span> <span begin="20.304" end="20.489">who</span> <span begin="20.489" end="20.704">were</span> <span begin="20.704" end="20.889">act</span><span begin="20.889" end="21.099">in&apos;</span> <span begin="21.099" end="21.299">real</span> <span begin="21.299" end="21.519">fun</span><span begin="21.519" end="21.724">ny</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他身边的那些朋友表现的极其诡异</span></p><p begin="21.721" end="24.901" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.721" end="21.891">They</span> <span begin="21.891" end="22.101">said</span> <span begin="22.101" end="22.321">the</span> <span begin="22.321" end="22.786">town&apos;s</span> <span begin="22.786" end="23.086">out</span><span begin="23.086" end="23.481">side</span> <span begin="23.481" end="23.676">and</span> <span begin="23.676" end="23.876">it</span> <span begin="23.876" end="24.066">ain&apos;t</span> <span begin="24.066" end="24.476">even</span> <span begin="24.476" end="24.676">sun</span><span begin="24.676" end="24.901">ny</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他们说: 全城的人都在外面了，这天气甚至阴云密布</span></p><p begin="25.102" end="27.345" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.102" end="25.260">And</span> <span begin="25.260" end="25.444">the</span> <span begin="25.444" end="25.625">boun</span><span begin="25.625" end="25.845">ty</span> <span begin="25.845" end="26.038">is</span> <span begin="26.038" end="26.245">a</span> <span begin="26.245" end="26.458">whole</span> <span begin="26.458" end="26.664">lot</span> <span begin="26.664" end="26.854">of</span> <span begin="26.854" end="27.059">mon</span><span begin="27.059" end="27.345">ey</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而那笔赏金可真是数额巨大</span></p><p begin="28.871" end="31.831" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.871" end="29.036">He&apos;s</span> <span begin="29.036" end="29.226">sweat</span><span begin="29.226" end="29.426">ing,</span> <span begin="29.611" end="29.796">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="29.796" end="30.016">blleed</span><span begin="30.016" end="30.226">ing,</span> <span begin="30.431" end="30.631">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="30.631" end="30.851">hav</span><span begin="30.851" end="31.041">ing</span> <span begin="31.041" end="31.241">trou</span><span begin="31.241" end="31.421">ble</span> <span begin="31.421" end="31.621">breath</span><span begin="31.621" end="31.831">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他在流汗，他在流血，他感到呼吸困难</span></p><p begin="32.026" end="34.981" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.026" end="32.201">His</span> <span begin="32.201" end="32.621">friends</span> <span begin="32.621" end="32.991">died,</span> <span begin="32.991" end="33.176">there&apos;s</span> <span begin="33.176" end="33.401">no</span> <span begin="33.401" end="33.796">time</span> <span begin="33.796" end="33.996">he</span> <span begin="33.996" end="34.201">ain&apos;t</span> <span begin="34.201" end="34.636">even</span> <span begin="34.636" end="34.831">griev</span><span begin="34.831" end="34.981">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">战友已逝，刻不容缓，他甚至无暇悲伤</span></p><p begin="35.216" end="38.201" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.216" end="35.396">He&apos;s</span> <span begin="35.396" end="35.596">kick</span><span begin="35.596" end="35.771">ing,</span> <span begin="35.991" end="36.161">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="36.161" end="36.386">scream</span><span begin="36.386" end="36.566">ing,</span> <span begin="36.771" end="36.981">but</span> <span begin="36.981" end="37.181">he</span> <span begin="37.181" end="37.381">can</span> <span begin="37.381" end="37.601">take</span> <span begin="37.601" end="37.811">the</span> <span begin="37.811" end="38.001">beat</span><span begin="38.001" end="38.201">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他反抗着，他嘶吼着，但这副身躯经得起千锤百炼</span></p><p begin="38.391" end="39.871" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.391" end="38.596">So</span> <span begin="38.596" end="38.786">he</span> <span begin="38.786" end="38.976">just</span> <span begin="38.976" end="39.176">keeps</span> <span begin="39.176" end="39.396">re</span><span begin="39.396" end="39.596">peat</span><span begin="39.596" end="39.871">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以他只是不断重复着</span></p><p begin="41.012" end="44.157" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.012" end="41.375">My</span> <span begin="41.375" end="41.762">arms,</span> <span begin="41.762" end="42.162">my</span> <span begin="42.162" end="42.573">legs,</span> <span begin="42.573" end="42.972">my</span> <span begin="42.972" end="43.361">heart,</span> <span begin="43.361" end="43.761">my</span> <span begin="43.761" end="44.157">skull</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的双臂，我的双腿，我的心脏，我的头颅</span></p><p begin="44.157" end="47.312" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.157" end="44.548">My</span> <span begin="44.548" end="44.950">brain,</span> <span begin="44.950" end="45.352">my</span> <span begin="45.352" end="45.749">blood,</span> <span begin="45.749" end="46.133">but</span> <span begin="46.133" end="46.527">not</span> <span begin="46.527" end="46.922">my</span> <span begin="46.922" end="47.312">soul</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的大脑，我的鲜血，你尽可摧毁，但你夺不走我的灵魂</span></p><p begin="47.708" end="50.469" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.708" end="48.142">Stab</span> <span begin="48.142" end="48.479">me</span> <span begin="48.479" end="48.896">in</span> <span begin="48.896" end="49.299">my</span> <span begin="49.299" end="49.697">back,</span> <span begin="49.697" end="50.142">my</span> <span begin="50.142" end="50.469">friend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来吧朋友尽管背刺我</span></p><p begin="50.881" end="53.750" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.881" end="51.287">Fill</span> <span begin="51.287" end="51.691">me</span> <span begin="51.691" end="52.081">with</span> <span begin="52.081" end="52.876">adren</span><span begin="52.876" end="53.296">a</span><span begin="53.296" end="53.750">lline</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让肾上腺素充满我的身躯</span></p><p begin="53.748" end="56.858" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.748" end="54.053">My</span> <span begin="54.053" end="54.448">arms,</span> <span begin="54.448" end="54.878">my</span> <span begin="54.878" end="55.278">legs,</span> <span begin="55.278" end="55.673">my</span> <span begin="55.673" end="56.068">heart,</span> <span begin="56.068" end="56.448">my</span> <span begin="56.448" end="56.858">skull</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的双臂，我的双腿，我的心脏，我的头颅</span></p><p begin="56.858" end="1:00.048" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.858" end="57.253">My</span> <span begin="57.253" end="57.648">brain,</span> <span begin="57.648" end="58.033">my</span> <span begin="58.033" end="58.458">blood,</span> <span begin="58.458" end="58.843">but</span> <span begin="58.843" end="59.243">not</span> <span begin="59.243" end="59.663">my</span> <span begin="59.663" end="1:00.048">soul</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的大脑，我的鲜血，你尽可摧毁，但你夺不走我的灵魂</span></p><p begin="1:00.443" end="1:03.268" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.443" end="1:00.783">Kick</span> <span begin="1:00.783" end="1:01.218">me</span> <span begin="1:01.218" end="1:01.608">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:01.608" end="1:02.018">get</span> <span begin="1:02.018" end="1:02.453">up</span> <span begin="1:02.453" end="1:03.268">again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">踢倒我我也会再次站起</span></p><p begin="1:03.621" end="1:06.841" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.621" end="1:04.001">Fill</span> <span begin="1:04.001" end="1:04.411">me</span> <span begin="1:04.411" end="1:04.809">with</span> <span begin="1:04.809" end="1:05.616">adren</span><span begin="1:05.616" end="1:06.001">a</span><span begin="1:06.001" end="1:06.841">line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让肾上腺素充满我的身躯</span></p><p begin="1:06.954" end="1:09.629" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.954" end="1:07.149">He&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:07.149" end="1:07.379">get</span><span begin="1:07.379" end="1:07.579">ting</span> <span begin="1:07.579" end="1:07.974">up,</span> <span begin="1:08.189" end="1:08.439">yeah,</span> <span begin="1:08.626" end="1:08.779">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:08.779" end="1:08.968">get</span><span begin="1:08.968" end="1:09.179">ting</span> <span begin="1:09.179" end="1:09.629">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他站起来了，是的，他再次站起</span></p><p begin="1:10.188" end="1:13.018" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.188" end="1:10.388">He&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:10.388" end="1:10.573">look</span><span begin="1:10.573" end="1:10.793">ing</span> <span begin="1:10.793" end="1:11.193">rough,</span> <span begin="1:11.373" end="1:11.738">he</span> <span begin="1:11.738" end="1:11.948">bout</span> <span begin="1:11.948" end="1:12.148">had</span> <span begin="1:12.148" end="1:13.018">enough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以满身疮痍， 但他已经受够了</span></p><p begin="1:13.358" end="1:15.903" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.358" end="1:13.538">And</span> <span begin="1:13.538" end="1:13.753">so</span> <span begin="1:13.753" end="1:13.943">he</span> <span begin="1:13.943" end="1:14.383">stands,</span> <span begin="1:14.563" end="1:14.843">puts</span> <span begin="1:14.843" end="1:15.323">down</span> <span begin="1:15.323" end="1:15.533">his</span> <span begin="1:15.533" end="1:15.903">hands</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以他挺直脊梁，放下求饶的双掌</span></p><p begin="1:16.128" end="1:19.078" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.128" end="1:16.523">Tries</span> <span begin="1:16.523" end="1:16.723">to</span> <span begin="1:16.723" end="1:16.913">be</span> <span begin="1:16.913" end="1:17.118">a</span> <span begin="1:17.118" end="1:17.523">man,</span><span begin="1:17.718" end="1:18.118">tries</span> <span begin="1:18.118" end="1:18.303">to</span> <span begin="1:18.303" end="1:18.498">be</span> <span begin="1:18.498" end="1:18.718">a</span> <span begin="1:18.718" end="1:19.078">man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">试图像个男人那样反击，顶天立地</span></p><p begin="1:19.142" end="1:21.987" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.142" end="1:19.333">But</span> <span begin="1:19.333" end="1:19.472">there&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:19.472" end="1:19.609">a</span> <span begin="1:19.609" end="1:19.928">place</span> <span begin="1:19.928" end="1:20.093">in</span> <span begin="1:20.093" end="1:20.304">his</span> <span begin="1:20.304" end="1:20.690">mind</span> <span begin="1:20.690" end="1:20.907">where</span> <span begin="1:20.907" end="1:21.133">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:21.133" end="1:21.425">still</span> <span begin="1:21.425" end="1:21.573">just</span> <span begin="1:21.573" end="1:21.700">a</span> <span begin="1:21.700" end="1:21.987">kid</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但在他内心深处，仍觉得自己是个孩子</span></p><p begin="1:22.328" end="1:25.205" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.328" end="1:22.483">And</span> <span begin="1:22.483" end="1:22.684">he</span> <span begin="1:22.684" end="1:23.067">knows</span> <span begin="1:23.067" end="1:23.272">that</span> <span begin="1:23.272" end="1:23.492">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:23.492" end="1:23.876">grown,</span> <span begin="1:23.876" end="1:24.096">but</span> <span begin="1:24.096" end="1:24.335">they&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:24.335" end="1:24.476">un</span><span begin="1:24.476" end="1:24.676">der</span> <span begin="1:24.676" end="1:24.874">his</span> <span begin="1:24.874" end="1:25.205">skin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">虽然深知自己早已成年，但那恐惧已深入骨髓</span></p><p begin="1:25.458" end="1:28.430" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.458" end="1:25.649">Cause</span> <span begin="1:25.649" end="1:25.847">the</span> <span begin="1:25.847" end="1:26.248">scars</span> <span begin="1:26.248" end="1:26.449">on</span> <span begin="1:26.449" end="1:26.649">his</span> <span begin="1:26.649" end="1:27.038">back,</span> <span begin="1:27.038" end="1:27.255">fits</span> <span begin="1:27.255" end="1:27.470">the</span> <span begin="1:27.470" end="1:27.655">knife</span> <span begin="1:27.655" end="1:27.797">in</span> <span begin="1:27.797" end="1:28.018">his</span> <span begin="1:28.018" end="1:28.430">ribs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为背上的旧伤正契合了肋间的尖刀</span></p><p begin="1:28.687" end="1:31.597" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.687" end="1:28.847">Trades</span> <span begin="1:28.847" end="1:29.037">an</span> <span begin="1:29.037" end="1:29.422">eye</span> <span begin="1:29.422" end="1:29.627">for</span> <span begin="1:29.627" end="1:29.822">an</span> <span begin="1:29.822" end="1:30.207">eye</span> <span begin="1:30.207" end="1:30.397">and</span> <span begin="1:30.397" end="1:30.597">a</span> <span begin="1:30.597" end="1:30.797">fist</span> <span begin="1:30.797